    "title": "With restaurant reboot, steaks starting at $45, Jackson Hole Four Seasons offers Western flavors",
    "text": "The Mountain West culinary spirit lives on in Steadfire Chophouse.\nFrom exploring indigenous flavor profiles of sumac, amaranth, juniper and sassafras to sourcing steaks from ranches in Jackson Hole, Montana and Idaho, the elevated cuisine served by the new restaurant in the Four Seasons Resort holds a sense of place. The Teton Village chophouse opened in mid-July, succeeding Westbank Grill, a mountain-modern steak house that had been a Four Seasons signature for nearly two decades.",
